  <History Date="17-04-09" Author="Jonathan Moreton" Comment="Checked" />
  <History Date="11-02-10" Author="Gregory Haynes" Comment="Updated macro timings to 20 seconds" />
  <History Date="21-07-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed power on and locate.  Increased wheel resolution.  Standardised func names." />
  <History Date="21-07-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed 16bit raw ranges." />
  <History Date="21-07-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from V1200T-ER" />
  <History Date="06-04-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed random CMY macro to variable range in response to manufacturer bug report." />
  <History Date="06-04-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Removed prism func and simplified in response to manufacturer bug report." />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="27-04-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added missing Atlabase ID to Basic mode.  Fixed colour index range.  Recreated palettes." />
  <History Date="28-03-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added gobo swatches.  Revised colour function names.  Added colour swatches." />
  <History Date="28-03-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail" />
